OL,3,GNEWSAHealth workers run out of patience
OL,4,Awith Stormont budget delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Executive is now
OL,7,Fseven months into the financial year
OL,8,Fwithout a budget.
OL,10,FOne of the remarkable things about this
OL,11,Fsituation is the relatively muted
OL,12,Fpractical impacts.
OL,14,FPublic sector managers have adapted to
OL,15,Femergency budget procedures; the money
OL,16,Fstill flows, services are delivered,
OL,17,Fwages are paid.
OL,19,FBut this week real consequences began
OL,20,Fto emerge as hospital doctors ran out
OL,21,Fof patience and announced two strikes
OL,22,Fnext month.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
